# Replace with task title

## Required reading

For a skill placed at `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`, link `../../principles/engineering-behavior.md`,
`../../policies/data-handling.md`, `../../policies/change-safety.md`, and
`../../directory/README.md`. Check review status in `../../catalog.json`.

## When to use

State triggers, exclusions, and related workflows. Do not assert unverified platform facts.

## Inputs and prerequisites

List the target, evidence, access, and source topics needed. Identify which missing
inputs block safe investigation and which block execution only.

## Procedure

Number concrete steps. Include where to retrieve facts, how to decide between
branches, boundaries on actions, and how to verify the outcome. Do not invent
operational commands or numeric success thresholds.

## Stop and escalate

Specify missing-evidence, authorization, unexpected-state, and ownership conditions.

## Expected output

Specify evidence, source references, actions actually taken, verification results,
remaining uncertainty, and next owner action.
